# basePath Chapter9 

::OnContractSelectOpenCh9
@trigger 
@cutscene 
@once 

::AfterResearchCh9

@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Xavier}   Listen, Lake. 
{@Player}   Locke.
{@Xavier}   Whatever. 
{@Xavier}   I'm gonna keep it real. 
{@Xavier}   You're a pawn. 
{@Player}   ...Excuse me? 
{@Xavier}   This is all a game, you see, and pieces on the board are shifting.
{@Xavier}   No one reveals their strategy till it's in play, and once known it's already too late. 
{@Xavier}   Such is the game. 
{@Player}   Your point? 
{@Xavier}   My point is... 
{@Xavier}   You're a pawn, but every pawn can rise if given the right opportunity. 
{@Player}   Why... are you telling me this?
{@Xavier}   Simple, you have potential. 
{@Xavier}   And you’ll need people in… high places. 
{@Player}   Okay...
{@Xavier}   Holo you soon. 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh9
@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Mai}      Hi. 
{@Player}   Oh, hey Mai. 
{@Mai}      ...the protests are stirring up again. 
{@Mai}      Wolfram's Tungsten production has stopped. 
{@Player}   You doing alright?
{@Mai}      This is nothing new. 
{@Mai}      Wolfram's known for their revolts. 
{@Mai}      Hoping to see some change this time around. 
{@Player}   Yea...
{@Mai}      Get rid of the bug Locke. 
{@Mai}      Don't trust Dorian.
{@Player}   Wh- how do you- what??
{@Mai}      ...the call must've glitched. 
{@Mai}      Cya. 

::AfterFabrication 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

{@MAL}      Okey dokeeyyyyyyy CAP-tain!
{@MAL}      Time to submiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii-
{@MAL}      Hi Captiain, how are you doing today?
{@Player}   ...
{@MAL}      Your silence is reassuring! 
{@Player}   M.A.L... after this contract, we need to make a detour. 
{@MAL}      Oh, sounds good Captain!